    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Hollow Host</i> is a nightmarish roguelike horror experience where you are relentlessly pursued by an intelligent, ever-adapting creature. Explore a procedurally generated hellscape, possess corpses with unique abilities, and search for a way out of damnation\u2014if one exists.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Command the Dead</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take control of <strong>three unique corpses</strong>, each with specialized abilities to help you survive and escape. Whether it's brute force, speed, or holy smites, death becomes your weapon.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Hunted by Intelligence</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The monster isn't just scary\u2014it's <strong>smart</strong>. Driven by a real AI language model, it adapts, reacts, and remembers. It's not a scripted stalker... it's something worse.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A Hell That Shifts</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every run is different. The <strong>procedurally generated world</strong> rearranges itself each time you die. No safe path, no guaranteed exit\u2014only chaos and suffering.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Descend Into the Dungeons</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face forgotten horrors, ancient traps, and twisted lore as you venture deeper into the dark. Each of the three dungeon offers clues to <strong>break free from hell</strong>\u2014or bind you tighter to it.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Escape alone or with friends</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Including both a singleplayer campaign and a multiplayer online mode, you can face damnation alone or with other players. Extra snacks for the evil tormentor after you.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Hollow Host</i> is a nightmarish roguelike horror experience where you are relentlessly pursued by an intelligent, ever-adapting creature. Explore a procedurally generated hellscape, possess corpses with unique abilities, and search for a way out of damnation\u2014if one exists.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Command the Dead</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take control of <strong>three unique corpses</strong>, each with specialized abilities to help you survive and escape. Whether it's brute force, speed, or holy smites, death becomes your weapon.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Hunted by Intelligence</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The monster isn't just scary\u2014it's <strong>smart</strong>. Driven by a real AI language model, it adapts, reacts, and remembers. It's not a scripted stalker... it's something worse.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A Hell That Shifts</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every run is different. The <strong>procedurally generated world</strong> rearranges itself each time you die. No safe path, no guaranteed exit\u2014only chaos and suffering.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Descend Into the Dungeons</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face forgotten horrors, ancient traps, and twisted lore as you venture deeper into the dark. Each of the three dungeon offers clues to <strong>break free from hell</strong>\u2014or bind you tighter to it.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Escape alone or with friends</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Including both a singleplayer campaign and a multiplayer online mode, you can face damnation alone or with other players. Extra snacks for the evil tormentor after you.</p>",
